- PMID:34964109\n\nValidation:\n- Ran `robot convert --catalog src/ontology/catalog-v001.xml -i src/ontology/mondo-edit.obo -f obo -o mondo-edit.TMP.obo` successfully.\n- ODK normalization step (`make NORM` via the repo's docker-based workflow) could not be run in this environment because `docker` is not installed.\n\nCompleted checklist:\n- [x] Read imported issue context\n- [x] Checked whether a TSEN2 MONDO term already existed\n- [x] Verified the HGNC identifier already used for TSEN2 in MONDO (`HGNC:28422`)\n- [x] Updated the existing term rather than creating a duplicate\n- [x] Checked the edit back into `src/ontology/mondo-edit.obo`\n- [x] Committed only the ontology file changed for this task\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
